{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vkj6fDrOm21792657540.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港股下跌逾700點，指數一度跌穿22,900點水平。</p><p></p><p>恒指低開138點後跌幅擴大。指數跌至3個月低位。科網股拖低大市，網易跌百分之6，阿里巴巴及京東均跌穿100元關口。寧德時代延續上日跌勢，再跌逾百分之7。</p><p></p><p>傳聯想尋求20億美元銀團貸款，股價跌逾一成一。是表現最差的藍籌，醫藥股有沽壓，藥明生物及中生製藥跌百分之7至8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:22:53.530721+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T09:17:55.782268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:17:55.782268+00:00","content_hash":"0d6709f1b153b709df7753607ee57e2e21fd523c49affa555b69e8a0224fef8e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}